# Local AI-assistant and editor config.
#
# Each of these is a setting for one person's tools on one machine — which
# agent is wired to which MCP server, which skills that agent has locally.
# None of it changes what the product does, and a contributor using a
# different editor would have to keep deleting it.
.claude/
.codebuddy/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.kiro/
.qoder/
.vscode/
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.mcp.json
opencode.jsonc
